{"page":115,"verses":[{"verse_key":"5:42","surah":5,"ayah":42,"ar_uthmani":"سَمَّـٰعُونَ لِلْكَذِبِ أَكَّـٰلُونَ لِلسُّحْتِ ۚ فَإِن جَآءُوكَ فَٱحْكُم بَيْنَهُمْ أَوْ أَعْرِضْ عَنْهُمْ ۖ وَإِن تُعْرِضْ عَنْهُمْ فَلَن يَضُرُّوكَ شَيْـًٔا ۖ وَإِنْ حَكَمْتَ فَٱحْكُم بَيْنَهُم بِٱلْقِسْطِ ۚ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ يُحِبُّ ٱلْمُقْسِطِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"they listen eagerly to lies and consume what is unlawful. If they come to you [Prophet] for judgement, you can either judge between them, or decline- if you decline, they will not harm you in any way, but if you do judge between them, judge justly: God loves the just-","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"سَمَّـٰعُونَ","en_gloss":"Listeners","transliteration":"sammāʿūna","verse_key":"5:42"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لِلْكَذِبِ","en_gloss":"to [the] falsehood","transliteration":"lil'kadhibi","verse_key":"5:42"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَكَّـٰلُونَ","en_gloss":"devourers","transliteration":"akkālūna","verse_key":"5:42"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لِلسُّحْتِ ۚ","en_gloss":"of the forbidden","transliteration":"lilssuḥ'ti","verse_key":"5:42"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فَإِن","en_gloss":"So if","transliteration":"fa-in","verse_key":"5:42"},{"pos":6,"ar":"جَآءُوكَ","en_gloss":"they come to you","transliteration":"jāūka","verse_key":"5:42"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فَٱحْكُم","en_gloss":"then judge","transliteration":"fa-uḥ'kum","verse_key":"5:42"},{"pos":8,"ar":"بَيْنَهُمْ","en_gloss":"between them","transliteration":"baynahum","verse_key":"5:42"},{"pos":9,"ar":"أَوْ","en_gloss":"or","transliteration":"aw","verse_key":"5:42"},{"pos":10,"ar":"أَعْرِضْ","en_gloss":"turn away","transliteration":"aʿriḍ","verse_key":"5:42"},{"pos":11,"ar":"عَنْهُمْ ۖ","en_gloss":"from them","transliteration":"ʿanhum","verse_key":"5:42"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَإِن","en_gloss":"And if","transliteration":"wa-in","verse_key":"5:42"},{"pos":13,"ar":"تُعْرِضْ","en_gloss":"you turn away","transliteration":"tuʿ'riḍ","verse_key":"5:42"},{"pos":14,"ar":"عَنْهُمْ","en_gloss":"from them","transliteration":"ʿanhum","verse_key":"